{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act16side_level_act16side_01_beg",
  "groupId": "act16side",
  "stageId": "act16side_01",
  "title": "燈下黑",
  "storyCode": "GA-1",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act16side/level_act16side_01_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "06a4bba50b3be22f1fed8a6e585f038e43032f9e819a8e2cea1260e5b12d4cf4",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_262_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "尤卡坦......你不覺得，拉特蘭的飲食有點問題嗎......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤卡坦",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_263_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "相比謝拉格，這裡的口味確實有些偏甜了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤卡坦",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_263_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但是，露絲你不是喜歡甜食嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_262_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那也不能所有的食物都是甜的吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_262_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉，我開始懷念謝拉格了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_262_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "都怪菈塔托絲那個臭女人，說什麼要抓住一切機會重新提高家族的地位......結果她自己又不來，把我丟到這麼遠的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤卡坦",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_263_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這也是大夫人願意信任你的表現吧。畢竟在那件事之後的絕境裡，是靠著你和大夫人的共同努力，才確保了如今布朗陶家的地位。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_262_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "又把自己撇出去，尤卡坦，你該不會其實很享受隱居幕後的感覺吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤卡坦",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_263_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "對我來說，能看到露絲散發光芒就已經很滿足了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_262_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......唔唔，你什麼時候學得這麼油嘴滑舌了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤卡坦",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_263_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但是，夫人，這場會議或許確實比我們預想的更加有價值。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤卡坦",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_263_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "來之前，我們甚至以為不會有多少國家回應邀請。現在看來，可能還是低估了拉特蘭的影響力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_262_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "雖然你說得有道理......但是別想轉移話題！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻薄的萊塔尼亞人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_175",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（萊塔尼亞語）哎呀，你長沒長眼睛！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_262_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（萊塔尼亞語）是你撞上我的吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻薄的萊塔尼亞人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_175",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "多麼蹩腳的萊塔尼亞語，哪裡來的鄉下人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_262_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我來自謝拉格，謝拉格可不是什麼鄉下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻薄的萊塔尼亞人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_175",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "謝拉格？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻薄的萊塔尼亞人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_175",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "謝拉格是什麼地方？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "開朗的萬國信使",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_360_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "莎倫夫人，謝拉格是位於維多利亞、哥倫比亞、卡西米爾緩衝地帶的雪域國家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻薄的萊塔尼亞人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_175",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那片雪山中還有國家？哈，那不就是鄉下嗎！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻薄的萊塔尼亞人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_175",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "區區邊鄙小國的使者，也敢在本公爵夫人面前嘴硬？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_262_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......這位夫人，第一，我要再次強調，謝拉格並非你口中的“鄉下”。您不瞭解這個國家，可能是出於您的孤陋寡聞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_262_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "第二，撞上我的人是您，請您向我道歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻薄的萊塔尼亞人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_175",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "開朗的萬國信使",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_360_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "莎倫夫人，這裡是大教堂......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧倫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_355_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "莎倫夫人，請容我提醒，您現在身在拉特蘭，而不是在您的萊塔尼亞領地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻薄的萊塔尼亞人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_175",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你又是誰？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧倫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_355_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "拉特蘭的萬國信使。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻薄的萊塔尼亞人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_175",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "萬國信使，你是什麼意思？說什麼這裡是大教堂，怎麼，身為東道主，你想說拉特蘭會站在那個鄉下人一邊嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧倫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_355_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "拉特蘭站在規則一邊。所以，莎倫夫人，您應該向休露絲夫人道歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_262_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你知道我的名字？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧倫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_355_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "知道各國來使的名字是理所當然的事，不是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻薄的萊塔尼亞人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_175",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哦？這麼說，你很清楚我是誰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧倫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_355_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "當然，萊塔尼亞的法蘭西斯公爵夫人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧倫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_355_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但請容許我再次提醒您，這裡是拉特蘭，夫人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧倫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_355_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在拉特蘭，請尊重戒律與規則。無論您在萊塔尼亞享有怎樣的特權，在拉特蘭，它們並不存在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻薄的萊塔尼亞人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_175",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這就是拉特蘭的待客之道？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧倫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_355_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果您願意做“拉特蘭的客人”，拉特蘭自然會竭誠以待。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_361_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——奧倫，你什麼時候開始代表拉特蘭了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧倫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_355_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "作為拉特蘭的使者，我沒有這個資格嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_361_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在大教堂，你沒有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_361_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "莎倫夫人，請息怒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻薄的萊塔尼亞人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_175",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哼，樞機，現在想息事寧人，是不是有些晚了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_361_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "公爵夫人，我真誠地請求您的諒解。頂撞您的萬國信使會受到相應的處罰。晚些時候，您可以在下榻的賓館親眼確認教皇廳的誠意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_361_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "休露絲夫人，也請求您的原諒，這一小小誤會是我們工作不周所致。如果您願意寬宏地接受我的歉意，我希望能邀請您稍後往偏廳一敘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "休露絲看向尤卡坦，尤卡坦輕微地點了點頭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻薄的萊塔尼亞人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_175",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呵，拉特蘭人。罷了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_361_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "阿萊索，瑪蒂娜，請替我招待好三位貴賓。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_361_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "奧倫，隨我來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧倫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_355_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "處罰是吧，是，是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4036_forcer_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是的，司提望區這名死者沒有留下遺囑和遺囑預登記資訊，稍晚我會回到公證所提交二次確認流程。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4036_forcer_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "現在？我在司提望區中心醫院......不不，我沒事，是我遇到一個小姑娘摔傷了，正在帶她做檢查......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4036_forcer_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，我沒有交通肇事......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4036_forcer_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯，父母不在旁邊，她現在還在昏迷中，暫時無法確認家庭情況。等她醒來我會把她送回監護人身邊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4036_forcer_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "對了，如果一時醒不來，也許我會需要使用公證所權限......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4036_forcer_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......欸？可以把這作為實訓任務之一嗎？......好的，完成後我會補齊任務文書。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4036_forcer_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......啊，不好意思，我聯絡完了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "快嘴的醫院護工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_368_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒關係！醫生查完體了，沒有發現外傷，頭部也沒有，應該不是因為撞到頭部而昏迷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "快嘴的醫院護工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_368_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不過小姑娘有點低燒，可能本來就在生病。昏迷的具體原因還需要再做幾項檢查確認，但應該沒有大礙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "快嘴的醫院護工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_368_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "醫生把她安排在2127病房了，你可以在那邊等檢查結果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "快嘴的醫院護工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_368_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她是你妹妹嗎？你在執勤嗎？為什麼執行者執勤會帶著妹妹呀？我很少在司提望區碰到執行者呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4036_forcer_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......她不是我妹妹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "快嘴的醫院護工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_368_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那你為什麼送她來醫院？她是你的任務對象嗎？天哪，執行者真的這麼冷酷嗎？對這麼小的孩子執法？她做了什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4036_forcer_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
